      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"jffdougan\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jffdougan/48/1882_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> jffdougan:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Thanks. The responses were enlightening, too.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I learned that Paul is destined to build Omnitron!</p>\n<p>That is interesting. It’s cool to get the occasional glimpse into the logistics behind a game publisher. I’ve been playtesting a game design I was thinking of submitting, and that already seemed daunting, but production stuff is a whole new world. Respect to GtG’s behind the scenes efforts!</p>",
